{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take the challenge and join the investigation</strong></h2><br>We are proud to present a detective and adventure game &quot;CodeRed: Agent Sarah\u2019s Story - day one&quot;. Playing as special agent Sarah Young, you will be given the opportunity to carry out an investigation to capture a dangerous terrorist. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/639240/extras/2b82230114de0e3d1bb0936866614784.avif?t=1768244784\" width=616 height=814 /></span><br><br>The investigation is based on point&amp;click game play and is distinguished by extensive script, hand painted graphics, music composed specifically for the game, need to make moral choices as well as achievement system. <br><br>Agent Sarah\u2019s comment:<br><br>&quot;I only have three days to save New York from complete annihilation. Should you decide to help me, I will require full cooperation from you. Together we will have to make tough decisions, not only work related ones. The situaiton is serious so you\u2019ll have to keep a cool head.&quot;","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Dirty Oscar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/639240/d4e09ca59f302573ac283e0278258ea4376aa98f.jpg"},{"name":"Junkie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/639240/81fdc48014ef2b0e14a96e6f904004b0e545c7ec.jpg"},{"name":"Snitch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/639240/bce9e35ef0c7778b02c4aec7c521207c9be22ce2.jpg"},{"name":"Toper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/639240/6fe48142eadc4c38aca3ea088113d7df8688cc5c.jpg"},{"name":"An old crock from the back","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/639240/06ea3c6cdad28c45b18d8ed85c7ecdb7a3473cdd.jpg"},{"name":"Jail","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.co